      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I retract my statement about changing the collision matrix of the mirror copies. The mirror copy collision matrix is set to collide with the player. That's how people fly. If you do change it the way I suggested, there's going to be quite a bit of outrage. The use cases for stuff with colliders and rigid-bodies behaving correctly locally is far smaller than the number of people who use them to fly.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
