      "private": false,
      "reactions": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I'd say the best bet is to just expose the playercollider layer used for the capsule colliders on the playerController that vrchat uses, and let us exclude it from our colliders if we want.  The inability to do this ruined one avatar I was working on.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
    {
